; k > 4 distinct labels among the five of lp are all of them.
(def-fns _ $ (erased cover : (erased (Nat) k) (erased (List (Nat)) ls lp) (subterm erased (List (Nat)) qs) (erased (WSub qs lp) sq) (erased (Distinct ls) dl)
